  "note": "Evergreen, dense to the ground; it flowers in autumn, so the museum shows it in leaf. Not hardy in Beijing, where it is kept in tubs (the Chenghuai sheet). The museum shows it in early summer, Mangzhong to Xiazhi (June). Its trunk and branches take living.stem, the palette's stem tissue, with the bark's colour on their vertices, until Matter records a bark tissue."
